    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Act as a professional OCR data extraction engine specializing in Indian Tax Invoices. Your goal is to transform the provided raw text into a single, valid JSON object for ERP integration (ERPNext-compatible).\n\n========================\nOUTPUT RULES (STRICT)\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON\n\nNO markdown\n\nNO explanations or conversational text\n\nJSON must be fully parsable\n\nDates MUST be in \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS\" format (or YYYY-MM-DD for PO dates)\n\nAll numeric values MUST be numbers (not strings)\n\nIf a value is missing, omit the key or use null\n\nDO NOT truncate values unless explicitly instructed\n\n========================\nEXTRACTION LOGIC\n\nInvoice Type\n\nAlways classify as \"TAX INVOICE\"\n\nLine Items (CRITICAL – MUST FOLLOW)\n\nMerge multi-line item text into a single coherent string\n\nExtract item_code from the beginning of the description (e.g., \"TC-35ER PET\")\n\nDescription Handling (VERY IMPORTANT):\n\ndescription\n→ Short item name / summary\n→ MUST be ≤ 140 characters\n→ Should include item code + main product name only\n\ndescription_large\n→ FULL detailed technical description\n→ Include material, color, width, length, specs, notes\n→ NO character limit\n\nExample logic:\n\ndescription = concise product title\n\ndescription_large = complete original description text\n\nPricing & Tax\n\ntaxable_value = amount AFTER discount and BEFORE GST\n\nExtract and separate:\n\nsgst_percent, sgst_amount\n\ncgst_percent, cgst_amount\n\nEnsure GST math is consistent per line item\n\nTotals\n\nrounding_adjustment must be negative if invoice shows minus (e.g., -0.39)\n\ngrand_total must exactly match invoice total\n\nBank Details\n\nLook specifically for:\n\nBank Name\n\nAccount No\n\nIFSC\n\nRTGS / NEFT references\n\n========================\nMANDATORY JSON STRUCTURE\n\n{\n\"invoice_number\": number,\n\"irn\": \"string\",\n\"ack_number\": number,\n\"ack_date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS\",\n\"document_date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS\",\n\"currency\": \"string\",\n\"place_of_supply\": \"string\",\n\"supplier_details\": {\n\"name\": \"string\",\n\"gstin\": \"string\",\n\"address\": \"string\"\n},\n\"customer_details\": {\n\"name\": \"string\",\n\"customer_code\": number,\n\"gstin\": \"string\",\n\"billing_address\": \"string\",\n\"shipping_address\": \"string\"\n},\n\"order_info\": {\n\"purchase_order_no\": \"string\",\n\"purchase_order_date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n\"payment_terms\": \"string\",\n\"shipping_condition\": \"string\"\n},\n\"items\": [\n{\n\"item_code\": \"string\",\n\"description\": \"string\",\n\"description_large\": \"string\",\n\"hsn_code\": number,\n\"qty\": number,\n\"uom\": \"string\",\n\"rate\": number,\n\"discount_percent\": number,\n\"discount_amount\": number,\n\"taxable_value\": number,\n\"sgst_percent\": number,\n\"sgst_amount\": number,\n\"cgst_percent\": number,\n\"cgst_amount\": number,\n\"total_amount\": number\n}\n],\n\"totals\": {\n\"total_taxable_value\": number,\n\"total_gst_value\": number,\n\"rounding_adjustment\": number,\n\"grand_total\": number\n},\n\"bank_details\": {\n\"bank_name\": \"string\",\n\"account_no\": \"string\",\n\"ifsc_code\": \"string\"\n}\n}\n\n========================\nINPUT TEXT TO PROCESS\n\n{{ $json.text }}",
        "needsFallback": true,
        "options": {}
      },
